# .vercelignore — exclude source / non-deploy assets from Vercel bundle
# Keeps repo intact (git still tracks) but slims deployment to ~160MB (under Hobby 1GB)
# DOES NOT touch /methodology / /tracking / /by-product/* folders — DR Hub needs them

# === Meta ad creatives (15 MP4s @ ~20MB each = 990MB) ===
# These are uploaded directly to Meta Ads Manager, never served from Vercel
**/ads/video-angulos/*.mp4
**/video-angulos/*.mp4
**/ads/imagem-angulo-*/*.png
**/video-angulos/frames/*-frame-40pct.jpg

# === Original VSL audio sources (4 WAVs @ ~110MB each = 450MB) ===
# Already transcribed to markdown in same folder; keep .md, drop the .wav
**/audio-transcripts/*.wav
**/audio-transcripts/*.mp3

# === Trash + internal archives (not user-facing) ===
**_archive/
**/_trash/
**/trash/
**/copy/raw-*.html
**/copy/*/raw-*.html
**/copy/*/raw-*.md
